											"value": {
												"html": {
													"value_i18n": {
														"en_US": "<div class=\"f-text font-size-paragraph-base\"><style>\n\t.company-description-container {\n\t\twidth: 846px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-description-icons-container {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\tborder: solid 1.5px #E2E2E4;\n\t\twidth: 846px;\n\t}\n\n\t.company-icon {\n\t\theight: 48px;\n\t\twidth: 48px;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-inner {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\theight: 353px;\n\t\toverflow: hidden;\n\t\twidth: 682.99px;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-next, .carousel-control-prev {\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\ttransition: all .3s ease-in-out;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-next:hover, .carousel-control-prev:hover {\n\t\tbackground: rgb(0, 0, 0);\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-prev:hover {\n\t\tbackground: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 90%);\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\ttransition: all .3s ease-in-out;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-control-next:hover {\n\t\tbackground: linear-gradient(-90deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 90%);\n\t\tborder-radius: 10px;\n\t\ttransition: all .3s ease-in-out;\n\t}\n\n\t.carousel-indicators li {\n\t\tborder-radius: 50%;\n\t\tborder: solid 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5) !important;\n\t\theight: 10px !important;\n\t\twidth: 10px !important;\n\t}\n</style>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t<div class=\"block-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"block-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center container d-flex flex-column\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"d-flex\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mr-5\">\n\t<div>\n\t\t<h2>\n\t\t\tMore Than an Out-of-the-Box Intranet\n\t\t</h2>\n\n\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t</p><p>Unlike traditional intranet implementations that take months to deploy, TeamPulse is designed for rapid rollout and enterprise scalability, allowing organizations to launch a modern digital workplace within weeks.</p><br><br> <p>For organizations using Liferay DXP, TeamPulse becomes even more valuable through:</p> <ul> <li><strong>Adapt:</strong> Support growth across departments, workflows, communication models, and employee experience initiatives as business needs evolve.</li> <li><strong>Expand:</strong> Add new modules, workflows, and dashboards as your needs evolve.</li> <li><strong>Integrate:</strong> Connect with your existing ERP, HRMS, or legacy systems through APIs and webhooks.</li> <li><strong>Customize:</strong> Match your brand, navigation, and features to your corporate identity.</li> <li><strong>Scale:</strong> Built to handle hundreds to thousands of employees without breaking a sweat.</li> <li>Modernize: Empower employees with a collaborative, engaging, and efficient digital workplace.</li> </ul> \n\t\t<p></p>\n\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t<div id=\"text-images-block0\" class=\"carousel slide\" data-ride=\"carousel\">\n\t\t\t<ol class=\"carousel-indicators\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li data-target=\"#carouselExampleIndicators\" data-slide-to=\"0\" class=\"active border mx-1\"></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li data-target=\"#carouselExampleIndicators\" data-slide-to=\"1\" class=\" border mx-1\"></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li data-target=\"#carouselExampleIndicators\" data-slide-to=\"2\" class=\" border mx-1\"></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li data-target=\"#carouselExampleIndicators\" data-slide-to=\"3\" class=\" border mx-1\"></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li data-target=\"#carouselExampleIndicators\" data-slide-to=\"4\" class=\" border mx-1\"></li>\n\t\t\t</ol>\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center carousel-inner d-flex\">\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"carousel-item active\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img alt=\"Slide 0\" class=\"d-block w-100\" src=\"[$DOCUMENT_URL:/site-initializer/documents/group/solutions/teampulse/002.png$]\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"carousel-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img alt=\"Slide 1\" class=\"d-block w-100\" src=\"[$DOCUMENT_URL:/site-initializer/documents/group/solutions/teampulse/003.png$]\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"carousel-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img alt=\"Slide 2\" class=\"d-block w-100\" src=\"[$DOCUMENT_URL:/site-initializer/documents/group/solutions/teampulse/004.png$]\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"carousel-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img alt=\"Slide 3\" class=\"d-block w-100\" src=\"[$DOCUMENT_URL:/site-initializer/documents/group/solutions/teampulse/005.png$]\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"carousel-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img alt=\"Slide 4\" class=\"d-block w-100\" src=\"[$DOCUMENT_URL:/site-initializer/documents/group/solutions/teampulse/006.png$]\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<a class=\"carousel-control-prev\" href=\"#text-images-block0\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"prev\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"carousel-control-prev-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sr-only\">Previous</span>\n\t\t\t</a>\n\n\t\t\t<a class=\"carousel-control-next\" href=\"#text-images-block0\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"next\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"carousel-control-next-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"sr-only\">Next</span>\n\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"block-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"block-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align-items-center container d-flex flex-column\">\n\t<div>\n\t\t<h2>\n\t\t\tWhat the Platform Delivers\n\t\t</h2>\n\n\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t</p><p><a href=\"https://www.ignek.com/solutions/employee-experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">A         modern employee experience</a> platform that empowers teams with the tools, communication, and access they need     to work more efficiently, stay aligned, and contribute effectively across the organization.</p><br> <p><strong>Unified Workspace</strong>: Centralize announcements, updates, applications, and workplace resources into a     single digital workspace - reducing information fragmentation and improving everyday productivity.</p> <p><strong>Organizational Communication</strong>: Deliver targeted communication and important updates more effectively     across departments, improving organizational transparency and workforce alignment.</p> <p><strong>Employee Engagement &amp; Collaboration</strong>: Create a more connected workplace where employees can     collaborate, share ideas, participate in discussions, and contribute to organizational culture.</p> <p><strong>Event &amp; Activity Management</strong>: Simplify internal event planning, participation, and communication to     strengthen engagement and improve workforce interaction.</p> <p><strong>Knowledge &amp; Resource Hub</strong>: Provide employees with centralized access to policies, documents, media,     and operational resources — enabling faster access to business-critical information.</p> <p><strong>Work &amp; Task Visibility</strong>: Improve execution and accountability by enabling teams to manage activities,     track progress, and stay aligned on organizational priorities.</p> <p><strong>Organizational Clarity</strong>: Help employees better understand team structures, departments, and reporting     hierarchies through a clear and accessible organizational experience.</p> <p><strong>Employee-Centric Experience</strong>: Enable personalized experiences where employees can easily access     relevant tasks, updates, information, and workplace activities from a single platform.</p> <p><strong>Secure &amp; Controlled Access</strong>: Protect enterprise information through role-based access controls and     governed access management aligned with organizational security policies.</p> <p><strong>Anytime, Anywhere Access</strong>: Support modern work environments with a seamless digital experience     accessible across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.</p>\n\t\t<p></p>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div></div>"
